  "merger_description": "The I\u00a0Squared Capital group (**I\u00a0Squared Capital**), through its wholly owned special purpose vehicle,\u00a0proposes to acquire 100% of the fully paid ordinary shares in the capital of oOh!media Limited (**oOh!media**) by means of a scheme of arrangement (the **Acquisition**).\n\nI\u00a0Squared Capital is a private equity investment firm headquartered in the United States. It is focused primarily on infrastructure investment.\n\noOh!media is listed on the Australian Securities Exchange. oOh!media provides out-of-home advertising services. It supplies advertising space across billboards, airports, retail precincts, rail networks, offices, educational settings and other streetside environments. oOh!media also supplies creative, printing and data analytics services.",
